#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1429
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In &kde; 3.2 a common menu format is introduced at <ulink "
"url=\"http://freedesktop.org/Standards/menu-spec/\">"
"http://freedesktop.org/Standards/menu-spec/</ulink>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1432
#, no-c-format
msgid "Before &kde; 3.2:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1435
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Directory structure under <filename class=\"directory\">share/applnk</filename>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1438
#, no-c-format
msgid "Directory structure represents menu structure"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1441
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each <literal role=\"extension\">.desktop</literal> file represents a single "
"application"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1447
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It was difficult to rearrange the structure in &kde; 3.2 so the new menu "
"format:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1450
#, no-c-format
msgid "Defines structure in a single .menu file"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1451
#, no-c-format
msgid "Is based on categories"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1452
#, no-c-format
msgid "is shared between <acronym>GNOME</acronym> and &kde;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1453
#, no-c-format
msgid "Supports applnk style menus as well"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1458 kde-for-admins.docbook:1520
#, no-c-format
msgid "Example from <filename>applications.menu</filename>:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: programlisting
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1459
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<markup>\n"
"        &lt;Menu&gt;\n"
"            &lt;Name&gt;Office&lt;/Name&gt;\n"
"            &lt;Directory&gt;suse-office.directory&lt;/Directory&gt;\n"
"            &lt;Include&gt;\n"
"                &lt;Filename&gt;Acrobat Reader.desktop&lt;/Filename&gt;\n"
"                &lt;Filename&gt;kde-kpresenter.desktop&lt;/Filename&gt;\n"
"                &lt;Filename&gt;kde-kword.desktop&lt;/Filename&gt;\n"
"            &lt;/Include&gt;\n"
"        &lt;Menu&gt;\n"
"</markup>"
msgstr ""

